   "slot": "verifiability_narrative",
   "text": "The token's backing is held entirely in assets whose value can be checked directly on-chain, accounting for 100.0% of the total reserve. This single class comprises all collateral, with Ethereum (ETH) being the only asset present and representing the full 100.0% share of the backing.\n\nThere is no backing held in wrapped assets that require checking one layer down, nor is there any portion verified solely through issuer disclosures. Consequently, the reserve contains no disclosure-dependent nodes, meaning the entire value is transparent without relying on external reports or stale data.\n\nThe system's administration banner states that no admin power can alter backing — immutable. This rule ensures that the composition of the collateral cannot be changed by governance, preserving the integrity of the 100.0% on-chain checkable structure.",
